Ravi K.: For Python streaming, show both iterator and async generator versions. Keep them compact.
Maya S.: Drafted sync example:```python
# sync streaming (client.chat.stream returns iterator of chunks)
def print_stream(client, prompt):
    for chunk in client.chat.stream(prompt):
        if chunk.type == "delta":
            print(chunk.delta, end="")
        elif chunk.type == "error":
            raise RuntimeError(chunk.error)
```
Zoe L.: Nice. Async variant?
Maya S.: Async example:```python
async def print_stream_async(client, prompt):
    async for chunk in client.chat.stream(prompt):
        if chunk.type == "delta":
